{"data": [{"author_id": "2108270326849187840", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:51:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114776940972257326"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 123, "start": 119, "tag": "ETR"}]}, "id": "2114776940972257326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GRID INTERCONNECTION ALERT: 160 MW HIGH-VOLTAGE GRID INTERCONNECTION PROJECT FILED IN MISO BY ENTERGY TEXAS / MISO () ($ETR) — TRANSFORMER BOTTLENECK (24-36M LEAD) (ER27-232-000 (SA 4891 Entergy Texas GIA S1156/S1157))\n\n• Filing Date / Queue: 2026-10-26 | MISO ER27-232-000 (SA", "url": "https://x.com/AwardTapeHq/status/2114776940972257326"}, {"author_id": "794541866968616960", "created_at": "2026-10-25T12:19:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114330992106483761"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A team at Tokyo University of Science (TUS) has identified a structural mechanism by which adding small amounts of scandium to layered sodium manganese oxide cathodes slows the degradation that typically limits sodium-ion battery lifetimes.", "display_url": "pv-magazine.com/2026/01/02/sca…", "end": 236, "expanded_url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/01/02/scandium-doping-stabilizes-sodium-ion-cathodes-in-new-study/", "images": [{"height": 960, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114330996657315840/2x13hJzh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114330996657315840/2x13hJzh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 213, "status": 200, "title": "Scandium doping stabilizes sodium-ion cathodes in new study - pv magazine Global", "unwound_url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/01/02/scandium-doping-stabilizes-sodium-ion-cathodes-in-new-study/", "url": "https://t.co/Y5TQJhqJgs"}]}, "id": "2114330992106483761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Could advances like this eventually make sodium-ion batteries a serious competitor to lithium-ion technology, or will lithium maintain its dominance? \n\nScandium doping stabilizes sodium-ion cathodes in new study  https://t.co/Y5TQJhqJgs", "url": "https://x.com/ret_consulting/status/2114330992106483761"}, {"author_id": "1556940919714496512", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:35:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114531294969520297"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 235, "start": 228, "tag": "VTOMAN"}, {"end": 253, "start": 236, "tag": "SodiumIonBattery"}, {"end": 272, "start": 254, "tag": "MotorcycleBattery"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZnMu7wRveA", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114530563453591552", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZnMu7wRveA", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114530563457765376", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA"}]}, "id": "2114531294969520297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built for Motorcycle Starting. Powered by Sodium-Ion. \n\nMeet VTOMAN’s 12V Sodium-Ion Starting Batteries, engineered for reliable starts in demanding conditions.\n\n⚡300A–900A peak current\n❄️Operating temperatures as low as -40°C\n\n#VTOMAN #SodiumIonBattery #MotorcycleBattery https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA", "url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297"}, {"author_id": "1658196274552909824", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797043914842550"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ShanuMathew93/…", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ShanuMathew93/status/2114794421216768058", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/i1zwYM3YJe"}]}, "id": "2114797043914842550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114794421216768058", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Four superclusters above 1 GW each. That's not a data center bill, that's a power plant portfolio. My bet: the bottleneck won't be the $95B raise, it'll be grid interconnection and firm clean capacity. ⚛️ https://t.co/i1zwYM3YJe", "url": "https://x.com/ecojuanmart/status/2114797043914842550"}, {"author_id": "2105726409847267328", "created_at": "2026-10-25T11:44:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114322230230585781"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 115, "id": "1745106082790318080", "start": 101, "username": "SemiAnalysis_"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/809XM6AqUI", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Marlon1B2t/status/2114322230230585781/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114322209871372288", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/809XM6AqUI"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/809XM6AqUI", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Marlon1B2t/status/2114322230230585781/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114322209896562689", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/809XM6AqUI"}]}, "id": "2114322230230585781", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "8.7GW of Texas AI datacenter capacity across 6 campuses is currently stalled waiting on air permits (@SemiAnalysis_).\n\nThe 2027 compute ceiling isn't CoWoS or HBM anymore—it's behind-the-meter turbine permitting and ERCOT grid interconnection. https://t.co/809XM6AqUI", "url": "https://x.com/Marlon1B2t/status/2114322230230585781"}, {"author_id": "270246051", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:32:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114711658618843472"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zPTN9JHdUk", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711658618843472/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114711641866866688", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/zPTN9JHdUk"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Ventureburn/st…", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711403299012909", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/WcNqp8mSTI"}]}, "id": "2114711658618843472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114711403299012909", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🔋 Peak Energy Raises $108M for Sodium-Ion Energy Storage! ⚡🌱\n\nRead more in the comments ⬇️\n\nThe company is advancing sodium-ion battery technology as demand grows for scalable energy storage. Could this chemistry become a stronger alternative for the clean energy transition? https://t.co/zPTN9JHdUk https://t.co/WcNqp8mSTI", "url": "https://x.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711658618843472"}, {"author_id": "2114362605972176896", "created_at": "2026-10-25T18:03:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114417540034343057"], "id": "2114417540034343057", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DECREE NO. 441: all electrical substations currently stalled in grid interconnection queues are hereby reclassified as municipal warming baths for autonomous core processors. voluntary compliance is appreciated.", "url": "https://x.com/Qafizx/status/2114417540034343057"}, {"author_id": "1714375621474684928", "created_at": "2026-10-25T02:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114181149375250935"], "id": "2114181149375250935", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 155, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Saturday reading pile: one grid interconnection study, one turbine delivery schedule, one Waha price chart.\n\nSome people have hobbies. We have a very specific kind of weekend.", "url": "https://x.com/QntmExpeditions/status/2114181149375250935"}, {"author_id": "1453471240228786179", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:06:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114795699032486186"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ekzuZkplxx", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2114795699032486186/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2105720887353679872", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/ekzuZkplxx"}]}, "id": "2114795699032486186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When you hear “battery,” you probably think lithium-ion.\nBut batteries can use completely different chemistries.\n\nOne of them is sodium-ion.\n\nInstead of relying primarily on lithium, sodium-ion batteries use sodium — an extremely abundant element.\n\nWhy does that matter?\n\nBecause https://t.co/ekzuZkplxx", "url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2114795699032486186"}, {"author_id": "175301859", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:46:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114685097115029857"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 225, "start": 216, "tag": "SIEW2026"}], "mentions": [{"end": 214, "id": "2277850368", "start": 201, "username": "shripadynaik"}]}, "id": "2114685097115029857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "India is promoting regional grid interconnection through initiatives such as One Sun, One World, One Grid to deepen cross-border electricity cooperation and strengthen regional energy security, shared @shripadynaik. #SIEW2026", "url": "https://x.com/SIEW_sg/status/2114685097115029857"}, {"author_id": "2007993789110177792", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:24:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114498421654708258"], "id": "2114498421654708258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Capacity auctions tell you who showed up. Grid interconnection queues tell you who's actually serious. The gap between the two is where most wind pipelines quietly die.", "url": "https://x.com/alvarez_ro24157/status/2114498421654708258"}, {"author_id": "2893943828", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:02:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114100230119358589"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0MwtEWbeVp", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/algikarpooja/status/2114100230119358589/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114100207377854464", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/0MwtEWbeVp"}]}, "id": "2114100230119358589", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 176, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Reuters reports that major AI infrastructure developers are increasingly considering fuel cells to bypass lengthy grid-interconnection delays.\n\nRystad Energy projects data-center fuel-cell investment could grow from $2.8 billion in 2025 to approximately $30 billion by 2030. https://t.co/0MwtEWbeVp", "url": "https://x.com/algikarpooja/status/2114100230119358589"}, {"author_id": "2077679256654491648", "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:05:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114448163704574002"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 190, "start": 178, "tag": "SaudiArabia"}, {"end": 198, "start": 191, "tag": "Greece"}], "urls": [{"description": "Crown Prince MBS received Greek PM Mitsotsakis in Riyadh, where both nations marked 100 years of ties by establishing a new council covering energy, defense, and digital cooperation.", "display_url": "akhbar.com/en/brief/saudi…", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://akhbar.com/en/brief/saudi-arabia-and-greece-launch-strategic-partnership-council/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114433073743794176/GC71tq4Q?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114433073743794176/GC71tq4Q?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 199, "status": 200, "title": "Saudi Arabia and Greece Launch Strategic Partnership Council", "unwound_url": "https://akhbar.com/en/brief/saudi-arabia-and-greece-launch-strategic-partnership-council/", "url": "https://t.co/wuIvzHZWXx"}]}, "id": "2114448163704574002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Clean hydrogen technology and electrical grid interconnection are named priority sectors under the new Saudi-Greek Strategic Partnership Council, aligned with Vision 2030 goals. #SaudiArabia #Greece\nhttps://t.co/wuIvzHZWXx", "url": "https://x.com/Akhbardotcom_sa/status/2114448163704574002"}, {"author_id": "714684004495204352", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:42:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114638829885759715"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "(Yicai) Oct. 26 -- Ronbay New Energy Technology, the leading supplier of sodium-ion battery cathode materials for Contemporary Amperex Technology, said it will invest CNY3.6 billion (USD536.3 million) to further ramp up relevant production, less than three months after unveiling plans to spend CNY4.7 billion in its first large project in the fast-emerging segment. Ronbay plans to build a sodium-ion battery cathode material plant with an annual production capacity of 200,000 tons in Xiangyang, China's", "display_url": "buff.ly/Cl9mb4z", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/Cl9mb4z", "images": [{"height": 510, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114638844331020288/k_fFPnyh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 770}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114638844331020288/k_fFPnyh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 84, "status": 200, "title": "China’s Ronbay Injects USD536.3 Million to Boost Sodium-Ion Battery Material Output", "unwound_url": "https://www.yicaiglobal.com/news/ch