upports 0V shipment. For importers, the key is simple: confirm the shipping spec and required certifications before you order. https://t.co/BRcmW610rC", "url": "https://x.com/JackXia45715971/status/2114551243758543327"}, {"author_id": "1826503959500259328", "created_at": "2026-10-26T06:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114601223039115737"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "India’s transition toward a renewable-intensive energy system has incentivized the need for alternative energy storage technologies that are cost-effective, safe, and compatible with national resource availability. In this context, Sodium-Ion Batteries (SIBs) have emerged as a strategically relevant option, particularly for stationary and grid-scale applications. However, a consolidated assessment of India’s readiness for SIB development, encompassing scientific progress, industrial capability, and policy support, remains limited. This study attempts to address the gap through an India-centric, perception-based survey designed to evaluate challenges and priorities associated with SIB research and deployment. An online questionnaire was administered across India, yielding responses from 102 Indian participants actively engaged in sodium ion battery research who have already published work in the field. The survey integrated Likert-scale perception statements, multiple-choice priority qu", "display_url": "dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dial…", "end": 229, "expanded_url": "https://dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dialogue/article/view/126", "start": 206, "status": 200, "title": "A Survey on Sodium-Ion Batteries: Perspectives from Indian Researchers and Professionals", "unwound_url": "https://dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dialogue/article/view/126", "url": "https://t.co/uN6QGlXePd"}]}, "id": "2114601223039115737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 357, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "New in Dialogue: Phogat et al repor